{
    "title": "RH: Weight Loss and Fitness",
    "description": "RH is the all-in-one app designed to help you reach your health goals, no matter your fitness level or starting point!\r\n\r\nIf you want to transform and tone your body, regardless of age\u2026\r\n\r\nIf you're struggling to lose those stubborn pounds \u2026\r\n\r\nIf you've tried all the diets and workout trends out there and none has worked\u2026\r\n\r\nIf you're tired of counting points and calories, expensive gym membership or equipment\u2026\r\n\r\nIf you can\u2019t seem to fit exercise into your busy lifestyle\u2026\r\n\r\n\u2026then this flexible and easy-to-follow program with at-home exercise routines for all levels and delicious custom meal plans will help you stay in shape and lose your weight for good!\r\n \r\nLook your best, feel your best, live your best!\r\n\r\nMany of our members report an average weight loss of 15-25 lbs and see their body transform within 12 weeks. \r\n\r\nOur coaches and incredibly supportive members' group help you stay accountable and motivated along the way.\r\n\r\nHere are some of our features:\r\n*Low-Impact Workouts: Optimal plans for women over 40 to strengthen and tone your body and core in just 10-15 minutes a day! No equipment needed!\r\n*200+ Workout Videos: Access over 200 Pilates, Yoga, and Fitness videos for beginners to advanced levels.\r\n*Custom Meal Plans: Based on your dietary preferences, high in protein, fiber, and healthy fats to help you achieve your weight loss and fitness goals.\r\n*Recipe Library: Over 1,000 delicious recipes that make healthy eating enjoyable and sustainable.\r\n*Comprehensive Tracker: Log your meal plans, weight, water intake, mood, and exercise for increased accountability.\r\n*Daily Tips: Receive bite-sized information to empower your health decisions and stay informed on your path to success.\r\n*Supplement Recommendations: Get personalized advice to enhance your health journey from real experts.\r\n*Supportive Community: Join our members-only Facebook group with over 40,000 supportive members.\r\n*Expert Guidance: Weekly FAQ calls with top level nutrition experts and monthly live calls with health and fitness coaches.\r\n*12-Week Coaching Course: Comprehensive video coaching covering nutrition, exercise, and mindset advice.\r\n*24/7 Support: Our dedicated support team is available around the clock. Whether you have questions about your workout plan, need help with your meal tracking, or require technical assistance, you can chat with our team anytime.\r\n\r\nOur program and coaches have been featured in Forbes Health, The Guardian, Sky Sports, MarketWatch, Digital Journal, The Daily Mirror and Televisa Networks. \r\n\r\nSign up today and join over 400,000 RH members on their journey toward the best version of themselves yet.\r\n\r\nThis app is only available to paying account holders and does not offer a free trial.",
    "descriptionHTML": "RH is the all-in-one app designed to help you reach your health goals, no matter your fitness level or starting point!<br><br>If you want to transform and tone your body, regardless of age\u2026<br><br>If you&#39;re struggling to lose those stubborn pounds \u2026<br><br>If you&#39;ve tried all the diets and workout trends out there and none has worked\u2026<br><br>If you&#39;re tired of counting points and calories, expensive gym membership or equipment\u2026<br><br>If you can\u2019t seem to fit exercise into your busy lifestyle\u2026<br><br>\u2026then this flexible and easy-to-follow program with at-home exercise routines for all levels and delicious custom meal plans will help you stay in shape and lose your weight for good!<br> <br>Look your best, feel your best, live your best!<br><br>Many of our members report an average weight loss of 15-25 lbs and see their body transform within 12 weeks. <br><br>Our coaches and incredibly supportive members&#39; group help you stay accountable and motivated along the way.<br><br>Here are some of our features:<br>*Low-Impact Workouts: Optimal plans for women over 40 to strengthen and tone your body and core in just 10-15 minutes a day! No equipment needed!<br>*200+ Workout Videos: Access over 200 Pilates, Yoga, and Fitness videos for beginners to advanced levels.<br>*Custom Meal Plans: Based on your dietary preferences, high in protein, fiber, and healthy fats to help you achieve your weight loss and fitness goals.<br>*Recipe Library: Over 1,000 delicious recipes that make healthy eating enjoyable and sustainable.<br>*Comprehensive Tracker: Log your meal plans, weight, water intake, mood, and exercise for increased accountability.<br>*Daily Tips: Receive bite-sized information to empower your health decisions and stay informed on your path to success.<br>*Supplement Recommendations: Get personalized advice to enhance your health journey from real experts.<br>*Supportive Community: Join our members-only Facebook group with over 40,000 supportive members.<br>*Expert Guidance: Weekly FAQ calls with top level nutrition experts and monthly live calls with health and fitness coaches.<br>*12-Week Coaching Course: Comprehensive video coaching covering nutrition, exercise, and mindset advice.<br>*24/7 Support: Our dedicated support team is available around the clock. Whether you have questions about your workout plan, need help with your meal tracking, or require technical assistance, you can chat with our team anytime.<br><br>Our program and coaches have been featured in Forbes Health, The Guardian, Sky Sports, MarketWatch, Digital Journal, The Daily Mirror and Televisa Networks. <br><br>Sign up today and join over 400,000 RH members on their journey toward the best version of themselves yet.<br><br>This app is only available to paying account holders and does not offer a free trial.",
